OL,3,GNEWSA'It's a lot nicer going to a
OL,4,Afestival alone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the second time Tilly Davies is
OL,7,Fattending Reading Festival by herself.
OL,9,FThe 18-year-old, from Northamptonshire,
OL,10,Fsaid even though it could get "a bit
OL,11,Flonely", it was possible to make
OL,12,Ffriends and, once you get to enjoy the
OL,13,Fmusic, "it doesn't really affect you
OL,14,Fmuch".
OL,16,FLast year, she was supposed to come to
OL,17,Fthe annual event with friends but they
OL,18,Fcould not get tickets.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
