OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'It's a lot nicer going to a
OL,4,Afestival alone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite that, Tilly has once again made
OL,7,Fit to Richfield Avenue on her own,
OL,8,Fready for the weekend ahead, and says
OL,9,Fshe is having "such a great time" and
OL,10,Fwould definitely recommend the solo
OL,11,Fexperience to others. "It's a lot nicer
OL,12,Fgoing alone," she said, adding it meant
OL,13,Fshe could go and see whichever act she
OL,14,Fliked.
